{"id":"4019827634120898675","query":"演唱会","source_queries":["演唱会"],"text":"时代峰峻演唱会，重重要的就是那后来的纪录片（那群小孩就是在纪录片里面被大家解读辅酶）。纪录片里面记录了他们是如何排练的，他们的亲密举动。我说真的，天元真的需要一个好的记录老师，把他们这个舞台的前后都好好记录一下，台上台下。可惜刘俊昊不会舍得多花钱去雇人的，有这钱，他可以多买几个名牌包了。","username":"1084931997qq","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@1084931997qq/post/DfJS-9uEzhz","timestamp":"2026-10-31T04:26:58Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","is_reply":true,"relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱会"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-10-31T04:32:19.946585802Z","first_seen_at":"2026-10-31T04:32:35.086425Z","last_seen_at":"2026-10-31T04:32:35.086425Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_9c8a90baba70ad9f","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
